    "reviews": "\u201cRomance with Chocolate \u2013 hidden object is a nice casual game for lovers of this genre. The artwork is very nice and the game is easy to play and runs well. The soundtrack suits the game very well. The hidden object stages are very well done in terms of blending the object within the picture. You also have the option of replaying a level, in which you will need to find other objects that were not available to be collected during your first walkthrough.\u201d<br>zeepond (The_Cpt_FROGGY CLUB)<br>",
